WEBVTT

00:37.829 --> 00:41.958
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE

00:46.588 --> 00:47.464
Hey.

00:49.049 --> 00:50.633
Why do you keep fighting?

00:52.302 --> 00:53.803
You know you can't win.

00:55.472 --> 00:57.182
I'm not fighting to win.

00:59.225 --> 01:00.935
I'm fighting so they don't forget.

01:02.062 --> 01:04.647
So they don't forget what they did to us.

01:06.357 --> 01:09.944
To let them know that those who remember
what they did are still alive.

01:12.405 --> 01:13.615
To make them feel sorry.

01:14.657 --> 01:16.451
If they don't feel sorry,

01:18.161 --> 01:20.038
to make them feel guilty, at least.

01:22.499 --> 01:24.417
If they don't even feel guilty,

01:26.169 --> 01:28.296
then to get in their way,
to be a nuisance.

01:29.547 --> 01:30.673
To keep them on edge.

01:32.884 --> 01:35.053
That way, they won't forget either.

01:36.805 --> 01:38.431
Can't you forgive them?

01:39.099 --> 01:42.102
Not when they don't even feel
the need to apologize.

01:42.185 --> 01:45.396
They refuse to admit the fact
that those things even happened.

01:46.564 --> 01:48.942
Isn't it absurd for me to forgive them?

01:50.276 --> 01:51.277
Still,

01:52.695 --> 01:54.239
it's all in the past.

01:55.865 --> 01:57.450
People didn't have a choice then.

01:59.285 --> 02:00.203
Sure.

02:01.371 --> 02:02.580
The times were such.

02:03.414 --> 02:07.001
Some had to do what they did to survive.
We're all human after all.

02:08.878 --> 02:09.796
But

02:10.797 --> 02:14.843
it's also a human thing
to right the wrongs that we've done.

02:17.095 --> 02:19.055
If you don't bother to make an effort…

02:21.516 --> 02:23.434
the world will be much more terrible.

02:25.311 --> 02:26.646
How much do you trust me?

02:28.231 --> 02:29.899
There's no "how much" in trust.

02:31.276 --> 02:32.402
I just trust you.

02:35.113 --> 02:35.947
I wish

02:37.115 --> 02:38.992
I'd never met you in the first place.

02:41.286 --> 02:42.203
If I hadn't,

02:43.454 --> 02:46.958
I would've been perfectly fine
with becoming a monster.

03:04.851 --> 03:06.311
What are you playing at?

03:06.394 --> 03:07.645
I told you.

03:09.981 --> 03:11.065
I don't want to die.

03:22.160 --> 03:26.080
Thanks to Ho-jae,
I once had a dream for a moment.

03:40.553 --> 03:42.889
I dreamed that I could be like Ho-jae.

03:45.433 --> 03:48.811
Be human and act human.

03:49.854 --> 03:50.897
But…

03:52.899 --> 03:53.983
I couldn't.

03:56.319 --> 03:57.570
I was simply a monster.

03:59.447 --> 04:02.033
I don't care what happens
to anything but me.

04:02.617 --> 04:04.327
I feel no guilt

04:05.870 --> 04:07.205
or pangs of conscience.

04:07.288 --> 04:11.209
I kill when someone poses a threat.
I hunt when I'm bored.

04:11.292 --> 04:12.877
I feed when I'm hungry.

04:16.214 --> 04:17.257
And also…

04:20.218 --> 04:21.636
I get a good kick out of it.

04:25.265 --> 04:27.141
I heard Akiko was your mother.

04:29.352 --> 04:30.353
But do you know…

04:33.648 --> 04:35.692
how she came to her death?

04:38.903 --> 04:39.904
I do.

04:52.792 --> 04:54.335
What about it?

04:55.044 --> 04:56.838
So what? It's all in the past.

04:58.381 --> 05:02.135
Lady Maeda is the one
who raised and protected me.

05:04.887 --> 05:07.098
Don't you think she's been using you?

05:12.770 --> 05:15.273
A good son always answers "yes."

05:20.361 --> 05:21.362
You don't get it.

05:21.863 --> 05:24.157
I'm the one who used her

05:25.325 --> 05:26.617
so I could survive.

05:29.996 --> 05:30.913
So…

05:35.126 --> 05:36.336
just die.

05:36.919 --> 05:40.840
Yoon Chae-ok. Bring that woman to me.

05:41.507 --> 05:42.508
For Ho-jae's sake…

05:42.592 --> 05:46.804
Mr. Jang has to be the one
to lead her to her death.

05:46.888 --> 05:48.306
…you must die now.

05:55.396 --> 05:57.398
Freeze! Move and I'll shoot!

06:13.414 --> 06:15.750
Master Jang will be
very disappointed to know…

06:18.002 --> 06:20.129
that you've decided to become a monster.

06:26.094 --> 06:27.678
Wait, that person…

06:37.980 --> 06:39.607
Who are those people?

06:40.775 --> 06:43.694
You have to run,
or else you're going to die.

06:44.779 --> 06:46.239
What do you think you're doing?

06:56.791 --> 06:59.669
- Hey!
- Run as far away as you can. Now.

08:13.951 --> 08:15.286
Who was it?

08:15.870 --> 08:17.413
Who sent you?!

08:52.657 --> 08:55.743
There is no way for you to win here.

08:57.161 --> 08:58.371
Wanna bet?

09:02.208 --> 09:04.126
On whether I can win or not.

09:10.633 --> 09:14.637
In the end, Lady Maeda
will kill everyone around you.

09:16.347 --> 09:21.394
Because what she ultimately wants
is for you to be left alone.

09:25.273 --> 09:28.985
If you want to know where I stand,
I don't care who wins.

09:29.068 --> 09:31.946
I just want this fight to be over quickly.

09:35.157 --> 09:36.617
And for that to happen,

09:37.577 --> 09:39.203
this will come in handy.

09:50.631 --> 09:54.552
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN BENEVOLENCE AND EXPLOITATION

09:54.635 --> 09:58.556
EPISODE 7
MARGINAL MAN

10:03.811 --> 10:05.062
Ma'am, have mercy on him!

10:05.646 --> 10:08.566
Please have mercy on Ho-jae,
just this once!

10:09.650 --> 10:10.484
Please!

10:10.985 --> 10:13.779
I'll keep a good eye on him.

10:13.863 --> 10:17.867
I'll make sure he never shows up
in front of you again, Lady Maeda.

10:17.950 --> 10:21.287
I'll keep him in check however I can, so…

10:23.789 --> 10:25.916
please spare him this once.

10:26.500 --> 10:27.376
Can you

10:29.086 --> 10:30.921
bet your life on that promise?

10:41.098 --> 10:44.143
If you do let Ho-jae live…

10:46.062 --> 10:46.896
then yes.

10:47.897 --> 10:48.898
I'll bet my life.

11:01.744 --> 11:02.662
Ho-jae.

11:21.639 --> 11:22.473
Ho-jae.

11:24.433 --> 11:25.601
Ho-jae.

11:25.685 --> 11:27.978
Let's go home.

11:28.062 --> 11:29.188
Come on, Ho-jae.

11:31.857 --> 11:35.486
Let's go home now, okay?

11:35.569 --> 11:36.946
Let's go.

11:55.423 --> 11:57.550
Okay. I'll head over now.

12:01.554 --> 12:05.349
- No, stay here. I can go on my own.
- What? Where are you going?

12:05.433 --> 12:08.686
Kwon Yong-gil is awake
and asking for me. I'll be back.

12:26.412 --> 12:28.080
DETECTIVE NOH JI-SU

12:28.164 --> 12:30.040
Hey, how's it going so far?

12:33.961 --> 12:34.879
Captain.

12:37.757 --> 12:38.758
Captain.

12:40.092 --> 12:41.177
Captain!

12:50.978 --> 12:52.104
What is it?

12:52.188 --> 12:54.523
Lady Maeda seems to have
caught on to our plan.

14:35.040 --> 14:36.041
Welcome.

14:37.626 --> 14:38.836
I've been waiting for you.

14:58.105 --> 15:00.107
No wonder it was so quiet on the way here.

15:00.941 --> 15:04.528
It was the least I could do
for an old friend.

15:05.487 --> 15:06.864
Are we still friends?

15:06.947 --> 15:11.827
So much time has passed,
and so many things have changed,

15:11.911 --> 15:14.413
yet we still stand face to face like this.

15:16.081 --> 15:16.916
So maybe we are.

15:22.254 --> 15:23.964
Maybe that is why…

15:36.518 --> 15:38.854
it felt lonelier than I thought

15:40.731 --> 15:43.067
to be erased from your memories.

15:45.319 --> 15:47.780
If you knew how I remembered you,

15:49.490 --> 15:51.992
it would've been better
to leave my memories erased.

15:52.910 --> 15:54.244
It is always better

15:55.871 --> 15:58.791
to live with the painful memories we have

16:00.250 --> 16:01.251
than to have nothing.

16:01.835 --> 16:04.046
You are no longer pain to me.

16:05.673 --> 16:06.715
You are repulsive.

16:08.717 --> 16:10.094
Do you still think

16:11.345 --> 16:14.723
that all human lives are equal?

16:14.807 --> 16:16.767
Do you still think they're not?

16:16.850 --> 16:18.394
What about Yoon Chae-ok's life?

16:21.855 --> 16:25.109
Do you still feel the same way
about her life?

16:54.179 --> 16:55.639
I was always curious

16:56.473 --> 17:00.310
just how equal human lives were to you.

17:01.895 --> 17:05.441
Take your friend in the hospital,
for example.

17:09.778 --> 17:12.614
- You'll be moving to the general ward.
- What?

17:13.240 --> 17:14.074
Or

17:15.451 --> 17:16.952
that police friend of yours.

17:26.253 --> 17:29.131
And the child you're looking for, No. 71.

17:29.214 --> 17:32.342
What if you had to decide
between those three lives

17:33.343 --> 17:35.137
and Yoon Chae-ok's life?

17:37.014 --> 17:38.724
Which side would you choose?

17:38.807 --> 17:40.142
No.

17:41.351 --> 17:42.436
You didn't.

18:13.092 --> 18:14.802
Yoon Chae-ok is not down there.

18:15.844 --> 18:19.807
She will shortly have her Najin removed
in the water tank chamber.

18:22.017 --> 18:23.811
There are two possible outcomes.

18:23.894 --> 18:28.190
Will she lose her memories like you did
a year ago and become a different person?

18:29.691 --> 18:32.861
Or will she fail to escape the water tank

18:34.530 --> 18:35.781
and drown in it?

18:38.659 --> 18:39.493
Now,

18:40.494 --> 18:42.287
which side will you save first?

18:44.289 --> 18:45.290
Yoon Chae-ok?

18:58.679 --> 18:59.596
Throw her in.

19:02.307 --> 19:03.183
Or…

19:05.102 --> 19:06.270
your friends?

19:14.069 --> 19:15.737
Make a choice, Mr. Jang.

19:17.281 --> 19:19.449
You do not have much time.

19:19.533 --> 19:21.910
Why do you have to take it this far?

19:21.994 --> 19:24.079
I merely want to see for myself

19:25.330 --> 19:29.710
whether you speak the truth
and whether your word would apply here.

19:31.837 --> 19:32.838
What do you think?

19:33.338 --> 19:37.634
Do you still believe
all human lives are the same?

19:40.220 --> 19:43.932
Are they still equal?

20:14.129 --> 20:15.339
Mr. Jang!

20:47.037 --> 20:49.331
Captain!

21:43.468 --> 21:44.594
No. Don't come down.

21:53.562 --> 21:55.022
No! Don't come down!

21:56.023 --> 21:56.857
No!

22:22.924 --> 22:24.718
Hey, are you out of your mind?

22:24.801 --> 22:27.220
Why did you come down here?
What were you thinking?

22:37.939 --> 22:39.107
I've fought them before.

23:00.253 --> 23:01.088
Give up.

23:03.131 --> 23:04.716
You're not getting out of here.

23:06.593 --> 23:08.220
Where's Master Jang?

23:11.556 --> 23:12.808
Just tell me that.

23:18.647 --> 23:19.940
Is he still alive?

23:23.402 --> 23:26.071
He is alive,
but you won't be seeing him again.

23:34.704 --> 23:38.542
Jang Tae-sang has chosen
to save other people over you.

23:41.253 --> 23:42.921
And for that,

23:44.131 --> 23:47.342
he will be torn to pieces and killed.

23:53.140 --> 23:55.392
And you'll die in this water tank.

23:58.228 --> 24:01.481
If you wanted to win,
you should've been simpler about it.

24:01.565 --> 24:06.903
You two are too emotional,
and you act on too many frivolous reasons.

24:09.781 --> 24:12.993
Just as we each have our own reasons
for choosing to live…

24:18.206 --> 24:21.626
we also have our own reasons
for choosing death.

24:23.628 --> 24:25.213
Aren't you afraid of death?

24:43.231 --> 24:45.942
What we must really fear is not death…

24:55.076 --> 24:58.246
but being left all alone
and unable to die.

25:11.676 --> 25:13.303
Such a pity, those eyes.

25:18.391 --> 25:19.643
I really like them.

25:43.583 --> 25:45.460
What the heck? What is that?

25:45.544 --> 25:46.628
What is that?

25:46.711 --> 25:48.296
Stop talking for God's sake!

25:52.425 --> 25:53.468
Ho-jae!

25:57.347 --> 25:58.557
Hey, Ho-jae!

26:00.308 --> 26:01.601
Ho-jae, are you okay?

26:06.606 --> 26:08.108
What? Hold on.

26:08.191 --> 26:09.776
Wait! Go away!

26:13.530 --> 26:15.073
Start running!

26:15.156 --> 26:16.157
Cut them off.

26:19.536 --> 26:20.370
Damn it!

26:20.453 --> 26:22.247
My legs!

26:26.334 --> 26:27.919
- Shit.
- Cut it.

26:28.712 --> 26:31.214
Jong-hyeok's over there.
We have to take him.

26:31.298 --> 26:32.382
We have to hurry.

26:35.135 --> 26:35.969
Thank you.

26:37.470 --> 26:38.513
It's done.

26:41.891 --> 26:42.726
Ho-jae!

26:42.809 --> 26:45.687
There's an elevator back there. Go now!

26:47.022 --> 26:48.023
Damn it!

26:58.533 --> 26:59.701
I said go!

27:01.870 --> 27:03.371
Come on! Hurry!

27:43.745 --> 27:47.415
- What should I set the temperature to?
- All the way down to 18 degrees.

29:34.522 --> 29:35.523
That's enough.

29:43.448 --> 29:44.824
I know you're in pain too.

30:17.565 --> 30:20.068
Nitrogen gas has been detected.

30:20.151 --> 30:22.153
Please evacuate.

30:26.908 --> 30:29.953
Nitrogen gas has been detected.

30:30.995 --> 30:32.413
It's here!

30:35.917 --> 30:38.503
Nitrogen gas has been detected.

30:39.003 --> 30:40.338
Ho-jae, come on!

30:42.173 --> 30:43.800
What the hell is he doing?

30:47.512 --> 30:50.306
Wait! Ho-jae!

31:51.409 --> 31:52.493
Are you all right?

31:53.620 --> 31:54.913
Ho-jae!

31:54.996 --> 31:56.998
Are you okay?

31:57.790 --> 31:59.500
No time to talk right now.

31:59.584 --> 32:01.836
You'll find a long hallway
on the floor above.

32:01.920 --> 32:03.630
Go straight down to the end.

32:03.713 --> 32:07.800
Exit through the iron doors on the right,
and a passage will lead you outside.

32:07.884 --> 32:10.970
Wait a second. Hey, what about you?

32:11.054 --> 32:12.805
Yoon Chae-ok is still in here.

32:12.889 --> 32:16.309
No, don't. Don't do this, man!

32:18.186 --> 32:19.938
Call backup as soon as you get out.

32:20.563 --> 32:21.481
I will.

32:21.564 --> 32:22.398
Hold on, man.

32:23.107 --> 32:25.985
Come with us, okay?
Let's get out together.

32:26.527 --> 32:29.113
You have to save yourself at least!

32:32.450 --> 32:33.534
Go ahead without me.

32:34.369 --> 32:35.578
I'll bring her out.

33:51.195 --> 33:52.321
How is it progressing?

33:52.989 --> 33:56.075
The water temperature just dropped
to 20 degrees.

33:56.576 --> 33:58.619
It'll drop to 18 within three minutes.

33:59.370 --> 34:01.873
Then she will go into cardiac arrest.

34:08.254 --> 34:09.672
Master Jang.

34:12.133 --> 34:14.218
I wish to be with you.

34:17.138 --> 34:18.639
There is something

34:20.224 --> 34:22.185
I really want to tell you.

34:24.562 --> 34:26.564
There were so many things…

34:28.608 --> 34:30.068
I wanted to do with you.

35:01.057 --> 35:02.016
What is that?

35:05.061 --> 35:06.521
Wasn't her Najin asleep?

35:33.131 --> 35:34.215
Why did you do it?

35:36.050 --> 35:36.968
Did you really…

35:39.178 --> 35:40.596
intend to kill me?

35:44.142 --> 35:45.768
I should have killed you

35:47.395 --> 35:48.771
a year ago

35:50.314 --> 35:52.316
when you chose Mr. Jang over me.

35:57.905 --> 35:59.532
Was there ever a moment…

36:03.953 --> 36:05.955
in which you regarded me as your son?

36:08.666 --> 36:10.626
There are things that make humans weak.

36:12.336 --> 36:16.132
Mother, child, companion,
lover, homeland, to name a few.

36:17.800 --> 36:19.343
Once they imprison themselves

36:19.427 --> 36:21.637
by obsessing
over such trivial relationships,

36:22.597 --> 36:24.557
humans become endlessly useless

36:25.516 --> 36:27.101
and pitiful beings.

36:28.853 --> 36:33.024
They get taken advantage of
and become expendable, easily discarded.

36:34.901 --> 36:38.905
I did not raise you like that, Seung-jo.

36:40.406 --> 36:42.575
I whipped and trained you

36:42.658 --> 36:45.244
so that you would not be
tied down to anything,

36:45.745 --> 36:47.788
so that you could become perfect
on your own.

36:50.541 --> 36:52.460
But you continued to long for a mother

36:53.377 --> 36:55.046
and depended on Jang Tae-sang.

36:57.757 --> 36:59.008
How disappointing.

37:15.608 --> 37:16.651
Forgive me.

37:21.864 --> 37:23.366
Disappointment means

37:25.243 --> 37:27.328
that you had some expectations for me.

37:29.413 --> 37:30.331
Okay.

37:31.666 --> 37:32.792
I'll do better.

37:34.669 --> 37:36.212
I won't long for anyone…

37:38.130 --> 37:39.674
or expect anything ever again.

37:40.258 --> 37:41.092
So…

37:50.351 --> 37:51.769
accept me for who I am.

37:54.814 --> 37:56.399
I won't be tied down to you.

37:59.527 --> 38:01.320
I'll become perfect on my own.

39:32.036 --> 39:33.371
How beautiful.

40:05.903 --> 40:07.238
Her heart has stopped.

40:52.158 --> 40:53.951
I'll be taking that Najin.

42:03.729 --> 42:04.730
Do you think

42:05.773 --> 42:09.485
the good times will come to us?

42:13.072 --> 42:14.198
They surely will.

42:23.582 --> 42:26.210
I will make sure that they do.

42:55.322 --> 42:56.365
What is it?

42:58.617 --> 43:00.202
What's going to happen to me now?

43:00.786 --> 43:01.620
Well,

43:02.288 --> 43:06.709
you'll need to take responsibility
for the three people who have died.

43:08.919 --> 43:09.962
But

43:10.546 --> 43:13.465
I'll help you get qualified
for all the mitigating factors.

43:14.133 --> 43:15.050
Try not to worry.

43:18.512 --> 43:19.722
Move!

43:23.392 --> 43:24.393
What happened here?

43:25.519 --> 43:27.104
- Are you all right?
- I'm fine.

43:27.187 --> 43:29.189
- Are you badly injured? Can you move?
- Move!

43:29.273 --> 43:31.275
- I think I broke my leg.
- Oh no!

43:32.234 --> 43:35.988
We have to start an urgent search
of Jeonseung Biotech now.

43:36.071 --> 43:37.406
Let's get a warrant first.

43:37.489 --> 43:38.907
- Yes, sir.
- Shit!

43:39.867 --> 43:40.868
Are you okay, sir?

43:42.995 --> 43:44.496
Is it just the two of you?

43:53.005 --> 43:53.839
What did you say?

43:54.548 --> 43:55.799
Is it just the two of you?

44:00.596 --> 44:01.430
Yeah.

44:02.306 --> 44:03.223
Just us two.

44:03.307 --> 44:04.475
I see.

44:57.361 --> 44:59.822
The screen doors are opening.

45:03.617 --> 45:06.412
SEARCH AND SEIZURE CONDUCTED
AGAINST JEONSEUNG BIOTECH

45:06.495 --> 45:08.580
INVESTIGATION INTO
ILLEGAL HUMAN EXPERIMENTATION

45:08.664 --> 45:10.624
MULTIPLE TIP-OFFS OF HUMAN EXPERIMENTATION

45:10.708 --> 45:12.084
PROSECUTION SUMMONS CHAIRMAN

45:12.167 --> 45:13.794
HUMAN EXPERIMENTATION LAB NOT FOUND

45:24.304 --> 45:25.222
Yummy.

46:36.877 --> 46:39.630
Come on out and eat.
You're going to be late.

46:39.713 --> 46:40.547
Okay!

46:41.965 --> 46:43.467
Coming.

46:47.471 --> 46:49.223
Coming home late from school again?

46:51.058 --> 46:52.726
My club is holding a fundraiser.

46:52.810 --> 46:56.772
We'll be having drinks after that,
so I'll probably be very late.

46:59.775 --> 47:00.609
It's so good.

47:00.692 --> 47:02.277
- Good, huh?
- Yeah.

47:07.825 --> 47:10.536
Hey, do you have a boyfriend yet?

47:12.412 --> 47:14.164
A boyfriend?

47:17.584 --> 47:18.418
I mean…

47:21.505 --> 47:22.840
I'll get one when I get one.

47:28.053 --> 47:29.930
Here, have some meat too.

47:34.810 --> 47:36.520
So good.

47:39.189 --> 47:40.440
Your makeup looks lovely.

47:41.149 --> 47:43.527
I'm going to bag myself a guy
at the fundraiser.

47:44.611 --> 47:46.280
Your clothes are so pretty too.

47:48.448 --> 47:51.743
Sometimes I have this dream.

47:58.000 --> 48:01.545
A dream where
I chase after someone every night.

48:03.714 --> 48:05.132
I don't know who it is,

48:06.216 --> 48:07.843
and I can't remember much of it…

48:10.137 --> 48:13.640
but my heart aches and feels
as if it were torn before I wake up.

48:15.809 --> 48:17.477
Spring will soon pass,

48:19.021 --> 48:20.439
and it will be summer again.

49:55.575 --> 49:58.662
And we will live on again.

52:05.205 --> 52:09.209
IN REMEMBRANCE OF OUR COLLEAGUES
KIM HYEON-JUNG AND OH HYO-JEONG

52:40.073 --> 52:41.032
Keep it going.
